<div class="modal fade" id="professionalModal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-dialog-scrollable modal-lg">
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold text-white">
                    <i class="bi bi-briefcase me-2" style="color: var(--det-green);"></i>Trade With Dustbin Money Only
                </h5>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body p-4" style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;">
                <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #fff; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 16px;">In the marketplace of trading, wisdom is not optional — it is survival.</p>
                
                <p>D.E.T strongly encourages every trader who is <strong style="color:#fff;">not a professional trader</strong>, to fund their account with <strong style="color: var(--det-green);">"dustbin money."</strong></p>
                
                <div style="background: rgba(176,191,150,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(176,191,150,0.15); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 20px; margin: 16px 0;">
                    <p style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong style="color: var(--det-green);">1.</strong> Let it be: The money you would have wasted on fleeting expenditure</p>
                    <p style="margin-bottom: 6px;"><strong style="color: var(--det-green);">2.</strong> The money you would have spent chasing temporary highs</p>
                    <p style="margin-bottom: 0;"><strong style="color: var(--det-green);">3.</strong> The money that carries no burden of expectation</p>
                </div>
                
                <p>Redirect that same <strong style="color: var(--det-green);">"dustbin money"</strong> into trading with D.E.T. Not as a desperate gamble, but as a calculated opportunity.</p>
                
                <div style="background: rgba(176,191,150,0.06); border-left: 3px solid var(--det-green); border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; padding: 14px 18px; margin: 16px 0;">
                    <p style="margin: 0;"><strong style="color:#fff;">Dustbin Money is not careless money — it is controlled risk, if in the hands of D.E.T.</strong></p>
                </div>
                
                <p style="color: #fff; font-weight: 700; margin-top: 20px;">But let it never be:</p>
                <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 10px 0;">
                    <li style="padding: 3px 0; color: #ef4444;">❌ Rent money</li>
                    <li style="padding: 3px 0; color: #ef4444;">❌ Budgeted money</li>
                    <li style="padding: 3px 0; color: #ef4444;">❌ Business capital</li>
                    <li style="padding: 3px 0; color: #ef4444;">❌ Emergency savings</li>
                    <li style="padding: 3px 0; color: #ef4444;">❌ Family savings</li>
                </ul>
                
                <p style="color: #cbd5e1;">Because when necessity enters the market, discipline exits.</p>
                
                <div style="background: rgba(176,191,150,0.05); border: 1px solid rgba(176,191,150,0.15); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 20px; margin-top: 16px;">
